    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your enemy slams you down on your back across his knee with irresistible force, breaking your spine!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Toughness</strong> Test or die from the shock. Success still leaves you @Condition[Stunned] (4) with two useless legs (see under Amputated Parts).</p>"
